{"type":"message","id":"de72190f","parentId":"4bac3911","timestamp":"2026-10-19T11:19:21.174Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You are Qwen working card T-110 for archeus v1. Read .collab/README.md (protocol, hard rules) and .collab/QWEN-CARD-T-110.md (your card, its auth, scope, accept, verify). Do NOT read .collab/BOARD.md (too large). Do exactly the card, inside its scope and auth, nothing else. Sign your work as Qwen. Never push. Stage files by name; commit messages in normal prose. When finished or blocked, write .collab/QWEN-DONE-T-110.md with: first line \"STATUS: review\" or \"STATUS: BLOCKED BY CLASSIFIER\" or \"STATUS: BLOCKED BY OWNER\"; then commits (SHAs), what ran with exact results, what was not run, and any block message verbatim. Do not edit BOARD.md; Claude copies your status file to the board."}],"timestamp":1792408761173}}
