uestion 11)\n     2\t\n     3\tScope: **one registered account** (state-machines ��9); never global, never a mission or a task.\n     4\tCounted: executions on that account that ended ENDED_ERROR with the adapter's\n     5\t`failure: resource` (API errors, overload, transport failures �?" not the agent's own failure) or\n     6\t`auth`. A task-attributable error never counts.\n     7\t\n     8\t| Move | When |\n     9\t|---|---|\n    10\t| `error_storm` AVAILABLE/CONSTRAINED ��' DEGRADED | 5 resource errors within 10 min |\n    11\t| `errors_persist` DEGRADED ��' OPEN | 2 more resource errors while DEGRADED, and at least one beat (60 s) since the last move |\n    12\t| `cooldown_elapsed` OPEN ��' DEGRADED | 5 min in OPEN |\n    13\t| `probe_ok` DEGRADED ��' AVAILABLE | an execution on it ends ENDED_OK, or the adapter's `authenticate` probe succeeds after a beat |\n    14\t| `auth_failed` ��' UNAUTHENTICATED | an adapter reports `failure: auth` |\n    15\t\n    16\tAt most one level per beat. P10 already routes DEGRADED only as a fallback and never OPEN. A user\n    17\tcan disable the account at any time; no user action is required to recover.\n    18\t\n    19\t## 13. Pause, stop and the e-stop (question 8)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1792409125731}}
